期：筛选期（最长4周，含两次24h咳嗽监测）；双盲治疗期（12周）；安全性随访（末次给药后2周）","quote_sha256":"2b3a96a46a02639cc471e8d3555ca737b6ee9dac7dc5a1ea186d83f8ed542968","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_888686c1310a849fa905:r7:5f50b13d370ad80e","span_id":"es_followup_period"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_888686c1310a849fa905:revision:7","quote":"DMC是否计划：是","quote_sha256":"9967a9a75297ced2326ab733fa3b16934acdef641fa765dd50c1cd58219f4aa5","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_888686c1310a849fa905:r7:5f50b13d370ad80e","span_id":"es_dmc_planned"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_888686c1310a849fa905:revision:7","quote":"P2X3受体为ATP门控阳离子通道，高表达于气道C纤维与Aδ感觉神经末梢","quote_sha256":"8637c029490b668f47761ff68dc08cd531eefcbc57f8b40a550007796aecd2e1","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_888686c1310a849fa905:r7:5f50b13d370ad80e","span_id":"es_taste_mechanism"}],"evidence_review_advisories":[],"evidence_span_ids":["es_safety_endpoints","es_design_safety","es_followup_period","es_dmc_planned","es_taste_mechanism"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":5},"gap_items":[{"action":"获取KZ-617研究者手册，提取非临床和既往临床安全性数据后补充","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_s8_ib","missing_source_classes":["研究者手册（IB）"],"target":"安全性评价总述中研究药物已知风险与剂量限制性毒性描述"},{"action":"由医学经理与方案撰写团队确认访视操作清单后写入","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_s8_visit_schedule","missing_source_classes":["安全性评估访视操作手册"],"target":"各安全性评估项目（实验室、心电图、生命体征、味觉测试）在各访视的实施安排"},{"action":"由医学经理与DMC秘书协商确定章程后补充","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_s8_dmc_charter","missing_source_classes":["DMC章程"],"target":"DMC审查频率、数据提交格式和安全性触发标准"}],"heading":"安全性评价","missing_source_classes":["研究者手册（IB）","安全性评估访视操作手册","DMC章程"],"proposal_text":"本研究为随机、双盲、安慰剂对照、四臂平行剂量探索、多中心II期试验，旨在评价KZ-617片15mg、45mg和90mg每日两次口服连续治疗12周对难治性/不明原因慢性咳嗽患者的疗效与安全性。安全性评价贯穿筛选期（最长4周）、双盲治疗期（12周）和末次给药后2周的安全性随访期。安全性评估内容包括治疗期出现的不良事件（TEAE）和严重不良事件（SAE）的采集与报告、味觉障碍（采用味觉功能问卷联合客观味觉测试评估）、实验室检查、12导联心电图和生命体征监测。鉴于P2X3受体高表达于气道C纤维与Aδ感觉神经末梢，味觉障碍、口干和头痛为本研究重点关注的不良事件，需按组描述发生率并进行味觉障碍发生率的趋势检验。本研究计划设立独立数据安全监查委员会（DMC），对累积安全性数据进行定期审查。安全性分析基于安全性分析集，按治疗组别进行描述性汇总。","rationale":"已确认事实支持：四臂双盲设计、12周治疗加2周随访、安全性终点清单（TEAE/SAE、味觉障碍、实验室、心电图、生命体征）、味觉障碍为重点关注、DMC已计划、安全性分析按组描述。待医学经理确认：各安全性评估项目的具体访视时点和频率、味觉障碍停药阈值、DMC章程与审查频率、安全性分析集定义细节。","review_advisories":["本节重复了多项总体设计事实；建议压缩为与本节直接相关的信息。"],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_d828e848b004_fa7925ce7e0d5231","section_number":"8","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:9beaf80ee7558695c338103d","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_888686c1310a849fa905:r7:5f50b13d370ad80e","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:575d8d3f051337","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:9d9f7af69b49a5","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:20ca67d1098144","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:e181df50c65016","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:0f7f6cabfa781e"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20261004053811_f37e42eb","content_status":"partial","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_888686c1310a849fa905:revision:7","quote":"总体研究设计：随机、双盲、安慰剂对照、四臂平行剂量探索、多中心II期试验","quote_sha256":"5d0450d537b5743eede19d6f1135d72f798bc5993c2c65d460d629cb49002206","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_888686c1310a849fa905:r7:5f50b13d370ad80e","span_id":"es_design_safety"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_888686c1310a849fa905:revision:7","quote":"研究时期：筛选期（最长4周，含两次24h咳嗽监测）；双盲治疗期（12周）；安全性随访（末次给药后2周）","quote_sha256":"2b3a96a46a02639cc471e8d3555ca737b6ee9dac7dc5a1ea186d83f8ed542968","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_888686c1310a849fa905:r7:5f50b13d370ad80e","span_id":"es_followup_period"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_888686c1310a849fa905:revision:7","quote":"DMC是否计划：是","quote_sha256":"9967a9a75297ced2326ab733fa3b16934acdef641fa765dd50c1cd58219f4aa5","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_888686c1310a849fa905:r7:5f50b13d370ad80e","span_id":"es_dmc_planned"}],"evidence_review_advisories":[],"evidence_span_ids":["es_design_safety","es_followup_period","es_dmc_planned"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":3},"gap_items":[{"action":"由医学经理确认TEAE窗口定义后写入","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_s81_teach_window","missing_source_classes":["安全性数据采集操作规范"],"target":"TEAE采集窗口的精确定义（起始时点、是否包含基线前加重事件、随访期截止时点）"},{"action":"由医学经理与方案撰写团队确认访视操作清单","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_s81_visit_items","missing_source_classes":["安全性评估访视操作手册"],"target":"第2/4/8/12周及随访访视中各安全性评估项目的具体实施清单"}],"heading":"总则","missing_source_classes":["安全性评估访视操作手册","DMC章程","安全性分析集定义"],"proposal_text":"本章节规定KZ-617片II期剂量探索临床研究（方案编号R1A-KZ617-202）中安全性数据的采集、评估、记录和报告的一般原则。研究采用双盲设计，受试者按1:1:1:1随机分配至安慰剂组、KZ-617 15mg组、45mg组和90mg组，各组均接受每日两次口服给药，连续治疗12周，末次给药后进入2周安全性随访期。安全性评估覆盖治疗期出现的不良事件（TEAE）和严重不良事件（SAE），重点关注味觉障碍、口干和头痛等与P2X3受体拮抗剂药理作用相关的不良事件。安全性数据在双盲治疗期的第2、4、8、12周访视及末次给药后2周安全性随访访视中采集。本研究计划设立独立数据安全监查委员会（DMC）对累积安全性数据进行定期审查。安全性分析基于安全性分析集，按治疗组别进行描述性汇总，味觉障碍发生率进行趋势检验。","rationale":"已确认事实支持：双盲四臂设计、1:1:1:1随机、12周治疗加2周随访、访视时间点（第2/4/8/12周及随访）、DMC已计划、味觉障碍为重点关注、安全性分析按组描述加趋势检验。待确认：TEAE采集窗口的精确定义（是否包含首次给药前已存在但治疗后加重的AE）、安全性评估在各访视的具体项目清单、DMC审查频率和触发标准、安全性分析集的完整定义。","review_advisories":["本节重复了多项总体设计事实；建议压缩为与本节直接相关的信息。"],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_d828e848b004_2aaaece5de4b41e5","section_number":"8.1","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:9beaf80ee7558695c338103d","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_888686c1310a849fa905:r7:5f50b13d370ad80e","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:575d8d3f051337","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:9d9f7af69b49a5","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:20ca67d1098144","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:e181df50c65016","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:0f7f6cabfa781e"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20261004053811_f37e42eb","content_status":"partial","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_888686c1310a849fa905:revision:7","quote":"安全性终点：TEAE/SAE；味觉障碍（味觉功能问卷+客观味觉测试）；实验室；12导联心电图；生命体征","quote_sha256":"79ddd0da77ab22b5d158169fe772364ec12ae598344a956e9264a517d872d1b1","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_888686c1310a849fa905:r7:5f50b13d370ad80e","span_id":"es_safety_endpoints"},{"locator":"document:mwdoc_greenfield_proj_user_d828e848b004_4599f7b526b2bbc8:full-draft:9beaf80ee7558695c338103d","quote":"TEAE/SAE；味觉障碍（味觉功能问卷+客观味觉测试）；实验室；12导联心电图；生命体征","quote_sha256":"2f164b9c25e006d14db96f467c80099a6cf9c6732197e75ac77e4aecb50d4fdd","source_id":"protocol_full_draft_selection:9beaf80ee7558695c338103d","span_id":"es_sec82_current"},{"locator":"section:治疗期出现的不良事件（TEAE）|block:666|chunk:1","quote":"治疗期出现的不良事件（Treatment Emergent Adverse Events, TEAE）是指在给药后出现的任何不利的医学事件。ICH E9指南","quote_sha256":"0617861f19d2d66a8400da3204a0ac18ae707bd45f949bb0868ba3f6038339be","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:e181df50c65016","span_id":"es_teach_corpus"}],"evidence_review_advisories":[],"evidence_span_ids":["es_safety_endpoints","es_sec82_current","es_teach_corpus"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":1,"project_fact_spans":1},"gap_items":[{"action":"由医学经理确认TEAE窗口后写入","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_s82_teach_def","missing_source_classes":["安全性数据采集操作规范"],"target":"TEAE精确定义（采集窗口起止、是否包含基线前加重事件）"},{"action":"由医学经理确认SAE定义和报告要求后写入","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_s82_sae_def","missing_source_classes":["安全性数据采集操作规范"],"target":"SAE定义、分级标准（CTCAE版本或其他）和报告时限"},{"action":"由医学经理确认味觉评估工具后写入","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_s82_taste_method","missing_source_classes":["味觉评估操作手册"],"target":"味觉功能问卷具体版本和客观味觉测试具体方法"},{"action":"由医学经理确认安全性评估项目清单后写入","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_s82_lab_ecg","missing_source_classes":["实验室检查项目清单","安全性评估访视操作手册"],"target":"实验室检查具体项目、异常判定阈值、心电图和生命体征采集时点"}],"heading":"定义","missing_source_classes":["安全性数据采集操作规范","味觉评估操作手册","实验室检查项目清单"],"proposal_text":"本章节定义本研究安全性评价中使用的术语和评估方法。治疗期出现的不良事件（TEAE）指在给药后出现的任何不利的医学事件，包括治疗期间新出现的不良事件或治疗前已存在但治疗后严重程度加重的不良事件。严重不良事件（SAE）的定义、分级标准和报告要求依据本方案及适用法规执行。味觉障碍的评估采用味觉功能问卷联合客观味觉测试，味觉障碍作为本研究重点安全性关注事件，其发生率按治疗组别进行描述并开展趋势检验。实验室检查、12导联心电图和生命体征作为安全性评估的常规监测项目纳入安全性分析。上述安全性评估项目的具体采集时点、操作方法和判定标准详见访视操作清单。","rationale":"已确认事实支持：安全性终点清单明确列出TEAE/SAE、味觉障碍（味觉功能问卷+客观味觉测试）、实验室、12导联心电图、生命体征；味觉障碍为重点关注且需趋势检验。待确认：TEAE的精确采集窗口（是否包含基线前加重事件）、SAE的具体分级标准（是否采用CTCAE 6.0或其他）、味觉功能问卷的具体版本和客观味觉测试的具体方法（如T&T法）、实验室检查的具体项目和异常判定阈值、心电图和生命体征的采集时点。","review_advisories":["本节引用公司语料形成共性表述；定稿时请用本项目权威文件复核适用性。"],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_d828e848b004_331e7cdd8a00ce30","section_number":"8.2","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:9beaf80ee7558695c338103d","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_888686c1310a849fa905:r7:5f50b13d370ad80e","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:575d8d3f051337","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:9d9f7af69b49a5","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:20ca67d1098144","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:e181df50c65016","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:0f7f6cabfa781e"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20261004053811_f37e42eb","content_status":"source_gap","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[],"evidence_review_advisories":[],"evidence_span_ids":[],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":0},"gap_items":[{"action":"获取或编制本项目安全性数据采集操作规范，明确AE定义、CTCAE版本选择、报告路径和时限","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_s821_ae_def","missing_source_classes":["安全性数据采集操作规范"],"target":"本项目AE/SAE/SUSAR的完整定义、严重程度分级标准、采集窗口和报告时限"},{"action":"获取KZ-617研究者手册后提取安全性信息","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_s821_ib_risk","missing_source_classes":["研究者手册（IB）"],"target":"KZ-617已知风险信号、非临床安全性发现、既往临床不良事件谱和剂量限制性毒性"},{"action":"由医学经理确认味觉评估工具和操作规程后写入","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_s821_taste_protocol","missing_source_classes":["味觉评估操作手册"],"target":"味觉障碍专项评估规程（问卷版本、客观测试方法、异常判定阈值、停药标准）"},{"action":"由医学经理与药物警戒部门确认SUSAR处理流程","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_s821_susar","missing_source_classes":["SUSAR报告流程文件"],"target":"SUSAR识别、评估、报告对象和时限"}],"heading":"不良事件","missing_source_classes":["安全性数据采集操作规范","研究者手册（IB）","SUSAR报告流程文件","味觉障碍专项评估与报告规程"],"proposal_text":"","rationale":"本章节需要本项目专属的不良事件定义、采集窗口、严重程度分级标准（如是否采用CTCAE 6.0）、报告对象与时限、SUSAR处理流程、MedDRA编码版本、以及味觉障碍/口干/头痛等重点关注事件的专项采集和报告规则。当前允许来源中仅有跨适应症公司语料提供的ICH GCP通用AE定义和TEAE概念描述，属于监管共性结构参照，不能直接作为本项目已确认的实施规则写入正文。缺少本项目安全性数据采集操作规范、研究者手册中的已知风险描述和剂量限制性毒性信息，无法形成有实质项目信息的正文。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_d828e848b004_a0fc2719cba93d7e","section_number":"8.2.1","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:9beaf80ee7558695c338103d","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_888686c1310a849fa905:r7:5f50b13d370ad80e","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:575d8d3f051337","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:9d9f7af69b49a5","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:20ca67d1098144","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:e181df50c65016","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:0f7f6cabfa781e"]}],"source_bindings":[{"content_sha256":"766379fc3bcda4834d13a4ab768d70a7a32cd9928fc3380e78d16c31b961b2d5","locator":"document:mwdoc_greenfield_proj_user_d828e848b004_4599f7b526b2bbc8:full-draft:9beaf80ee7558695c338103d","role":"current_working_draft_packet","source_id":"protocol_full_draft_selection:9beaf80ee7558695c338103d","source_type":"protocol_full_draft_selection","source_version":"full-draft:09cd7d7ba68f642e5a3799055ef3721896a55a46dc138ed6e990460233b2997e:9beaf80ee7558695c338103d","text_sha256":"766379fc3bcda4834d13a4ab768d70a7a32cd9928fc3380e78d16c31b961b2d5"},{"content_sha256":"766189fa02dc7f84e587aa9cf712b9c03ef3f504177110092d01762943dd5d6b","locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_888686c1310a849fa905